@startuml

class Student {
  +studentId: String
  +name: String
}

class Room {
  +roomId: String
  +name: String
  +blocked: Boolean
  +block()
  +unblock()
}

class Booking {
  +bookingId: String
  +startTime: DateTime
  +endTime: DateTime
  +status: String
  +cancel()
}

Student "1" -- "0..*" Booking
Room "1" -- "0..*" Booking

note right of Booking
R2: Active bookings for the same room
cannot overlap.
end note

note right of Room
R3: A blocked room cannot accept
a new booking.
end note

note bottom
Assumptions:
A1: Touching bookings do not overlap.
A2: Blocking a room prevents new bookings
but does not cancel existing bookings.
end note

@enduml